{"id":"b8684802726abc97","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-prewellordering.md","title":"自然数上带外部元素的预良序","display":"df-prewellordering — 自然数上带外部元素的预良序","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-prewellordering","aliases":["18-df-prewellordering"],"display":"df-prewellordering — 自然数上带外部元素的预良序","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Definition 13.2.1","source_printed_pages":"337","source_pdf_pages":"345","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"定义；范数存在性作为所定义性质，不预先假定所有关系都有范数","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-prewellordering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-prewellordering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prewellordering — 自然数上带外部元素的预良序"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 13.2.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"337"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"345"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"定义；范数存在性作为所定义性质，不预先假定所有关系都有范数"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R,S\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为冯·诺伊曼序数类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in{}^P\\lambda\">\\(f\\in{}^P\\lambda\\)</span> 表示定义域恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>、值域包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 的集合函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\">\\(\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\)</span> 是下式引入的谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\">\\(R,S\\)</span> 在全体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 上取关系，故量词中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 可以不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>，序数比较取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land f\\in{}^P\\lambda\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land\\Bigl(y\\notin P\\lor\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in f\\land\\alpha\\le\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land\\Bigl(y\\notin P\\lor\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in f\\land\\alpha&lt;\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land f\\in{}^P\\lambda\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land\\Bigl(y\\notin P\\lor\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in f\\land\\alpha\\le\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land\\Bigl(y\\notin P\\lor\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in f\\land\\alpha&lt;\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists f\\in{}^P\\lambda\\;\n\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists f\\in{}^P\\lambda\\;\n\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Definition 13.2.1 在环境集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 上的版本。原书的预良序使用一个满射到序数的范数，并把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 外元素放在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 内元素之后；这不同于只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^2\">\\(P^2\\)</span> 上定义关系的通常简写。本节点保留这部分语义，供非单调阶段比较使用。</p>\n<p>公式以函数图展开涉及范数的比较，避免写出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin P\">\\(y\\notin P\\)</span> 时没有定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(y)\">\\(f(y)\\)</span>。范数是否存在正是所定义的性质，不在 Hypothesis 中先假定存在。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\varnothing\">\\(P=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时存在唯一空范数到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=S=\\varnothing\">\\(R=S=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 非空时，满射条件排除人为跳过序数层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-ordinal]]，序数比较取 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-ordinal]]，序数比较取 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R,S\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in{}^P\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)","display":false},{"tex":"R,S","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land f\\in{}^P\\lambda\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\lambda\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land\\Bigl(y\\notin P\\lor\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in f\\land\\alpha\\le\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land\\Bigl(y\\notin P\\lor\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in f\\land\\alpha<\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists f\\in{}^P\\lambda\\;\n\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega(P,R,S,\\lambda,f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P^2","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin P","display":false},{"tex":"f(y)","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"R=S=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":2860,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-prewellordering]]"},{"id":"91a23fe6cd503a7d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$P\\subseteq\\omega$，$R,S\\subseteq\\omega^2$；$\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-prewellordering]]。$\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega$ 与 $\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega$ 分别由下式定义传递性与良基性。后者量化全部 $\\omega$ 的子集；本节点是元理论命题，随后在弱二阶对象理论中使用同形公式时，需要保留该理论的集合量词解释。"},{"id":"a2393ecde85db745","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$。$P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-inductive-norm]]；$R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-stage-comparison]]；$\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega$ 与 $\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-prewellordering]]。量化的候选 $P$ 是 $\\omega$ 的子集，$R,S$ 是 $\\omega$ 上的二元关系；不假定 $\\Gamma$ 单调。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-prewellordering]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-prewellordering]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-prewellordering|18-df-prewellordering]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","592f91b518237a8b"]}